I've been knitting since before I could
read. My mother's mother taught me during
a rainy day at the beach. I was frustrated
at first -- I kept dropping stitches and 
forgetting to count -- but soon I got into
the rhythm. I liked how it busied my hands
and quieted my brain.
<<endPennyKnitting()>>
